  "notes": [
    "install-preview-next, install-deps-back, install-deps-confirm, install-configure-back, install-configure-install and install-done-close stay unplayed: the seed ships one package folder, seed-office-pack, and install_agent_package copies the folder before any duplicate check (commands/agent_packages/install.rs:79) then removes the install root on any later failure (install.rs:148), which is the seeded package directory every later section reads. The deps and configure steps need a manifest declaring pip packages or a webhook trigger without a secret (InstallPackageDialog.svelte:102-133); the seeded agent.toml declares neither, and a fixture folder under tests/cli/seed/files/agents/fixtures/ is a seed change outside this book.",
    "The update picker (plugin:dialog|open stub) is pointed at ${HOME}/.apollia/agents/no-such-agent/agent.py, a path the seed never creates: update_agent refuses it at commands/agents/lifecycle.rs:350-352 before the loader and before the copy onto install_path, so the banner and its details render and nothing is written. Never point it at the agent's own module: std::fs::copy onto the same path truncates it (README gotcha).",
    "Update and stop/start are played on agent-list-row nth 2, onboarding-agent (rows follow installed_agents ORDER BY name minus the worker: apollia-chat, apollia-guide, onboarding-agent). The update confirm panel needs a running agent (AgentDetailHeader.svelte:123-126); dashboard-det stops the first agents-at-work row, which is never onboarding-agent while apollia-chat or apollia-guide is loaded, so the row is active in master-det and standalone alike. The stop leaves the registry entry as stopped (list_agents maps it, Start appears through showStartButton, tabs/startVisibility.ts:17-21) and the start replaces it; agents.db is untouched, only the runtime id of onboarding-agent differs afterwards, which no recipe asserts.",
    "The narrow block resizes to 900 x 800 (SplitLayout.svelte:54 folds the list under 1024 px, the app sidebar stays inline above 768 px), contains no boundary click, and restores 1280 x 800 before the builder section.",
    "The install dialog is driven end to end on two fixture packages the seed copies under ~/.apollia/fixtures/ and never installs itself: seed-deps-pack (a pip dependency and a webhook trigger without a secret) reaches the dependency and configure steps and its install fails on pip on any machine because the declared package name resolves nowhere; seed-plain-pack installs for real (no dependency, no network) and lands on the done step. It stays installed for the rest of the boot: the package header's uninstall buttons carry no data-testid, so no recipe can remove it, and the seed is rebuilt at the next boot anyway.",
    "agent-install-error-details is reached through the sidebar install button (agents-install-button) with the picker answered by a path that does not exist: install_agent validates before any copy, so the banner appears without a write."
  ]
}
